{"role":"pseudoSymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#USDZ-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84%EC%9D%84-Swift-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C%EC%99%80-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics#USDZ-%EC%9D%B4%EB%A6%84%EC%9D%84-Swift-%EC%BD%94%EB%93%9C%EC%99%80-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","title":"USDZ 이름을 Swift 코드와 연결하기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"폴더와 빈 Swift 파일, 태양과 여덟 행성의 USDZ 모델이 미리 들어 있는 스타터 프로젝트에서 시작합니다. 모델을 불러와 한 줄로 놓은 뒤, 깊이 축을 따라 앞뒤로 배치합니다."}]},"02-scene-timeline.swift":{"content":["import SwiftUI","","struct SolarSystemView: View {","    var body: some View {","        TimelineView(.animation) { timeline in","            let now = timeline.date.timeIntervalSinceReferenceDate","","            \/\/ 태양과 행성의 중심을 같은 3D 공간에 놓습니다.","            SpatialContainer(alignment: .center) {","                PlanetModelView(assetName: \"Sun\")","","                ForEach(Planet.starter) { planet in","                    PlanetOrbitView(","                        planet: planet,","                        time: now","                    )","                }","            }","            .frame(width: 800, height: 380)","            .frame(depth: 620)","            .padding3D(24)","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","fileType":"swift","identifier":"02-scene-timeline.swift","fileName":"SolarSystemView.swift","type":"file","highlights":[{"line":5},{"line":6},{"line":8},{"line":9},{"line":10},{"line":11},{"line":12},{"line":13},{"line":14},{"line":15},{"line":16},{"line":17},{"line":19},{"line":20},{"line":21}]},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EA%B9%8A%EC%9D%B4%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%95%84%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0":{"kind":"section","role":"pseudoSymbol","title":"깊이를 레이아웃의 일부로 만들기","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics#%EA%B9%8A%EC%9D%B4%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%95%84%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EA%B9%8A%EC%9D%B4%EB%A5%BC-%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%EC%95%84%EC%9B%83%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B6%80%EB%A1%9C-%EB%A7%8C%EB%93%A4%EA%B8%B0","type":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"폴더와 빈 Swift 파일, 태양과 여덟 행성의 USDZ 모델이 미리 들어 있는 스타터 프로젝트에서 시작합니다. 모델을 불러와 한 줄로 놓은 뒤, 깊이 축을 따라 앞뒤로 배치합니다."}]},"02-planet-motion.swift":{"syntax":"swift","content":["import Foundation","","struct Planet: Identifiable, Hashable {","    let name: String","    let assetName: String","    let depth: CGFloat","    let orbitRadius: CGFloat","    let orbitDuration: TimeInterval","    let rotationDuration: TimeInterval","    let rotationDirection: Double","","    var id: String { assetName }","","    static let starter: [Planet] = [","        .init(name: \"수성\", assetName: \"Mercury\", depth: -70, orbitRadius: 56, orbitDuration: 10, rotationDuration: 2.8, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"금성\", assetName: \"Venus\", depth: -50, orbitRadius: 84, orbitDuration: 14, rotationDuration: 4.2, rotationDirection: -1),","        .init(name: \"지구\", assetName: \"Earth\", depth: -30, orbitRadius: 112, orbitDuration: 18, rotationDuration: 3, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"화성\", assetName: \"Mars\", depth: -10, orbitRadius: 140, orbitDuration: 22, rotationDuration: 3.2, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"목성\", assetName: \"Jupiter\", depth: 10, orbitRadius: 172, orbitDuration: 28, rotationDuration: 2.4, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"토성\", assetName: \"Saturn\", depth: 30, orbitRadius: 204, orbitDuration: 34, rotationDuration: 2.7, rotationDirection: 1),","        .init(name: \"천왕성\", assetName: \"Uranus\", depth: 50, orbitRadius: 236, orbitDuration: 40, rotationDuration: 3.6, rotationDirection: -1),","        .init(name: \"해왕성\", assetName: \"Neptune\", depth: 70, orbitRadius: 268, orbitDuration: 46, rotationDuration: 3.4, rotationDirection: 1)","    ]","}"],"identifier":"02-planet-motion.swift","type":"file","fileType":"swift","highlights":[{"line":7},{"line":8},{"line":9},{"line":10},{"line":15},{"line":16},{"line":17},{"line":18},{"line":19},{"line":20},{"line":21},{"line":22}],"fileName":"Planet.swift"},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80%ED%84%B0-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8-%EC%97%B4%EA%B8%B0":{"role":"pseudoSymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/01-SpatialLayoutBasics#%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80%ED%84%B0-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8-%EC%97%B4%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/01-spatiallayoutbasics#%EC%8A%A4%ED%83%80%ED%84%B0-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%A0%9D%ED%8A%B8-%EC%97%B4%EA%B8%B0","title":"스타터 프로젝트 열기","abstract":[{"text":"폴더와 빈 Swift 파일, 태양과 여덟 행성의 USDZ 모델이 미리 들어 있는 스타터 프로젝트에서 시작합니다. 모델을 불러와 한 줄로 놓은 뒤, 깊이 축을 따라 앞뒤로 배치합니다.","type":"text"}]},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas":{"kind":"overview","role":"overview","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas","title":"SwiftUI로 만드는 3D 태양계 도감","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WWDC25 「SwiftUI 공간 레이아웃 만나보기」 세션에서 소개한 Spatial Layout API를 직접 적용해 봅니다."}]},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/--------------":{"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/--------------","kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/--------------","title":"행성 정보 인터랙션 만들기","abstract":[]},"spatial-layout-rotation.svg":{"alt":"회전한 뷰의 경계 상자까지 레이아웃에 반영하는 개념도","type":"image","identifier":"spatial-layout-rotation.svg","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/spatial-layout-rotation.svg","traits":["1x","light"],"svgID":"title"}]},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/04-RealityKitIntegration#%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84-%EA%B0%B1%EC%8B%A0-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0":{"role":"pseudoSymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/04-RealityKitIntegration#%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84-%EA%B0%B1%EC%8B%A0-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/04-realitykitintegration#%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4-%EC%83%9D%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%BC-%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EC%9E%84-%EA%B0%B1%EC%8B%A0-%EB%82%98%EB%88%84%EA%B8%B0","title":"장면 생성과 프레임 갱신 나누기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Chapter 3을 마친 프로젝트에서 이어갑니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Planet"},{"type":"text","text":"과 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetInfoCard"},{"type":"text","text":"를 사용하면서 태양계를 그리는 화면을 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RealityView"},{"type":"text","text":"로 옮깁니다. 지름 정규화, 장면 생성과 갱신, 이름 레이블, 공간 탭을 순서대로 연결합니다."}]},"02-orbit-rotation.swift":{"content":["import SwiftUI","","struct PlanetOrbitView: View {","    let planet: Planet","    let time: TimeInterval","","    private var orbitAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.orbitDuration","        ) \/ planet.orbitDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360)","    }","","    private var spinAngle: Angle {","        let progress = time.truncatingRemainder(","            dividingBy: planet.rotationDuration","        ) \/ planet.rotationDuration","        return .degrees(progress * 360 * planet.rotationDirection)","    }","","    private var orbitX: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(cos(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    private var orbitDepth: CGFloat {","        CGFloat(sin(orbitAngle.radians)) * planet.orbitRadius","    }","","    var body: some View {","        PlanetModelView(assetName: planet.assetName)","            \/\/ 자전은 모델에만 적용합니다.","            .rotation3DLayout(spinAngle, axis: .y)","            \/\/ 공전 위치는 자전과 분리하고, 앞 장의 z축 이동량을 더합니다.","            .offset(x: orbitX, y: -orbitDepth * 0.3)","            .offset(z: planet.depth + orbitDepth * 0.6)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","fileType":"swift","identifier":"02-orbit-rotation.swift","fileName":"PlanetOrbitView.swift","type":"file","highlights":[{"line":21},{"line":22},{"line":23},{"line":24},{"line":25},{"line":26},{"line":27},{"line":28},{"line":31},{"line":32},{"line":33},{"line":34},{"line":35}]},"doc://co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation/tutorials/SolarSystemAtlas/04-RealityKitIntegration#%ED%83%9C%EC%96%91%EB%B6%80%ED%84%B0-%EC%83%88-%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0":{"role":"pseudoSymbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/co.kr.youngmin.SolarSystemAtlas.step-by-step.documentation\/tutorials\/SolarSystemAtlas\/04-RealityKitIntegration#%ED%83%9C%EC%96%91%EB%B6%80%ED%84%B0-%EC%83%88-%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","kind":"section","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/solarsystematlas\/04-realitykitintegration#%ED%83%9C%EC%96%91%EB%B6%80%ED%84%B0-%EC%83%88-%EC%9E%A5%EB%A9%B4%EC%97%90-%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","title":"태양부터 새 장면에 연결하기","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Chapter 3을 마친 프로젝트에서 이어갑니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Planet"},{"type":"text","text":"과 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlanetInfoCard"},{"type":"text","text":"를 사용하면서 태양계를 그리는 화면을 "},{"type":"codeVo